ont-family:Arial\"><u>Melancholy</u> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fortitude (focus, grounded, calculating, intellectual, confident)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resilience+Unswayable Mind</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resilience+Enduring Beasts</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resilience+Toughness (If you have the merit VResilience)</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Obfuscate (depressed, scared, sad, wanting to high from the world)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Silence of Death+Unseen Passage</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><u><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Phlegmatic </span></span></u><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Auspex (calm, relaxed, open)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Heightened Senses+Sense the Unseen</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dominate (controlling, sentimental, understanding, conmen and \u201cdark empaths\u201d)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cloud Memory + Mesmerize</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Compel+Mesmerize</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><u><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Animal Blood</span></span></u><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Animalism</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bond Famulus+Feral Whispers</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Protean</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Eyes of the Beast+Feral Weapons</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Weight of the Feather+Feral Weapons</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Adding In an Anthor Corporis or a quick Fixatio</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Heightened Senses+Sense the Unseen)+Unerring Aim</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Silence of Death+Unseen Passage)+Unliving Hive</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Silence of Death +Unseen Passage)+Uncanny Grip/Flight/Spider Crawl</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Lethal Body+ Soaring Leap)+Brutal Feed</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Lethal Body+Soaring Leap)+Shapechange/Metamorphoses </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Share the Senses(hive mind if brewed as multiple units and taken together)</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6922,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","user":"Houston810","date":". 05-29-2021, 09:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","name":"Houston810","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T08:05:26-07:00","id":1450172,"title":"","content":"The subject header is a bit... misleading LOL.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T13:10:42-07:00","id":1450216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450163-thin-blood-master-race?p=1450172#post1450172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The subject header is a bit... misleading LOL.</div> </div> </div> </div>Slander, Thin-bloods are the next evolution of vampires. With the potential to have all of their strengths and none of their weaknesses. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","name":"Houston810","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-30T22:06:30-07:00","id":1450395,"title":"","content":"This kind of min-maxing to bend a character build as far as you can without breaking it is usually considered poor sport in tabletop rpg's, but as someone closer to 50 than I am to 40 I can appreciate the personal horror of the next generation of vampires having enough supernatural kick to threaten the oldsters with obsolescence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-30T23:47:34-07:00","id":1450404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450163-thin-blood-master-race?p=1450395#post1450395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This kind of min-maxing to bend a character build as far as you can without breaking it is usually considered poor sport in tabletop rpg's, but as someone closer to 50 than I am to 40 I can appreciate the personal horror of the next generation of vampires having enough supernatural kick to threaten the oldsters with obsolescence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I honestly believe it will be a slow burn before the community realizes exactly that. With the correct evolutionary pressures thin-bloods blow the old-guard away. In my personal head canon that's the real reason caitiff and thin-bloods have always been hunted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","name":"Houston810","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T04:01:24-07:00","id":1450435,"title":"","content":"To be honest, I don't understand what OP is meant to convey. Thin-bloods... can have two discipline powers? Well, yeah? What's the gimmick here? What's the catch?<br /> <br /> Don't rely on having two powers though, because you have 1/5 chance of each feed being Intense resonance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T09:27:00-07:00","id":1450461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450163-thin-blood-master-race?p=1450435#post1450435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be honest, I don't understand what OP is meant to convey. Thin-bloods... can have two discipline powers? Well, yeah? What's the gimmick here? What's the catch?<br /> <br /> Don't rely on having two powers though, because you have 1/5 chance of each feed being Intense resonance.</div> </div> </div> </div>You actually have a 100% chance, and if you can't see the benefit of having 3 active powers of your choosing and being able to swap through them then you need more help than I am willing to provide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","name":"Houston810","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}